    "Prints the project name above the marks, to tell the sheets apart. In SignMaster: Job Name." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imprime el nombre del proyecto encima de las marcas, para distinguir las hojas. En SignMaster: Job Name."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imprime le nom du projet au-dessus des repères, pour distinguer les feuilles. Dans SignMaster : Job Name."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Imprime o nome do projeto por cima das marcas, para distinguir as folhas. No SignMaster: Job Name."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prints the sheet, then shows how to load it in the machine." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
